Open Mafia Research is an open library of research on sports Mafia.
The library was created and is maintained by Anatolii Dudko, also known
by the gaming nickname Ignostik.

The library may contain studies written by other members of the sports
Mafia community. Copyright in each such study belongs to its authors,
who are named in the study itself. By adding a study to this library,
its authors agree that it is distributed under the terms of this
project's license.

